## Scope

`apps/web` has **no Wagmi** and **no `@/wallet/` UI**. Do not add wallet connect in the web app.

Web3 auth is Fastify SIWE/SIWS plus `@repo/react` verify hooks. Next `/auth/callback/web3` exists; do not add wallet adapters or Wagmi providers in the web app.

